# LWC Design System — Principal Deal Desk

## Philosophy
Large, confident whitespace that breathes rather than feels empty. Organic shapes and
soft curves replacing sharp grids. Warm neutral palettes with single, deliberate accent
colors pulled from the org theme. Typography treated as a design element, not just a
vessel for words.

## Color Palette
- Page background: #FAF7F2 (warm off-white)
- Card background: #FFFFFF
- Accent (primary): var(--lwc-colorBrand) — always use org theme variable, never hardcode
- Accent light (backgrounds/badges): use var(--lwc-colorBrand) at 15% opacity
- Text primary: #1a1a1a
- Text secondary: #6b6b6b
- Subtle box background: #F5F2ED
- Border color: #e5e5e5

## Typography
- Font stack: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif
- Section labels: 11px, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.12em, color #6b6b6b
- Card titles: 16px, font-weight 700, color #1a1a1a
- Hero numbers (scores): 64px, font-weight 800, color var(--lwc-colorBrand)
- Body text: 13px, line-height 1.7, color #3e3e3c
- Never use Salesforce default blue (#0176d3) as a hardcoded color

## Cards
- border-radius: 20px
- box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)
- padding: 24px
- background: #FFFFFF
- Accent left border: 4px solid var(--lwc-colorBrand)
- Never use lightning-card for main content panels — use custom styled divs

## Spacing
- Page padding: 32px
- Between major sections: 24px margin-bottom
- Between cards in a grid: 16px gap
- Inside action item rows: 12px padding, 10px border-radius
- Always err on the side of more whitespace, never less

## Component Patterns

### Score/Metric display
- Large hero number at 64px bold in var(--lwc-colorBrand)
- Circular SVG progress ring: viewBox 0 0 120 120, strokeWidth 6
  - Background track: stroke #f0ede8
  - Progress arc: stroke var(--lwc-colorBrand)
  - Use stroke-dasharray 283 and stroke-dashoffset computed as: 283 - (value/100 * 283)

- Pill shape: border-radius 20px, padding 4px 12px
- Background: var(--lwc-colorBrand) at 15% opacity
- Text: var(--lwc-colorBrand)
- Font: 12px font-weight 600

### Section headings
- All caps, 11px, letter-spacing 0.12em, color #6b6b6b
- Margin-bottom 12px before content

### Action item cards
- background: #F5F2ED
- border-radius: 10px
- padding: 12px 16px
- font-size: 13px
- No border, no shadow — just the warm background

### Executive/person rows
- Small circle avatar: 32px, background var(--lwc-colorBrand) at 20% opacity
- Initials: var(--lwc-colorBrand), font-weight 700, font-size 12px
- Name bold 13px, title #6b6b6b 12px

### Quick Start card
- border-radius: 16px
- soft shadow
- padding: 16px
- accent left border
- Each row: small icon + text, 13px, line-height 2

## CSS Files
Always create a matching .css file for every .html file in the LWC folder.
Never use inline styles when a CSS class can be used instead.
Always use SLDS layout classes (slds-grid, slds-col, slds-gutters) for structure,
but override visual styling with custom CSS classes. 
  
## What to avoid
- No sharp corners (border-radius below 8px on cards)
- No Salesforce default lightning-card for main content panels
- No hardcoded blue colors
- No cramped spacing — if in doubt, add more padding
- No plain unstyled bullet lists — wrap in styled containers
- No all-caps body text
